(footprint "LTR-559ALS-01" (version 20221018) (generator pcbnew)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Lite-On LTR-559ALS-01 ambient light + proximity sensor with built-in IR emitter, 8-pin ChipLED 2.36 x 3.94 x 1.35 mm. Land pattern from datasheet DS86-2013-0003 section 14 (p.38/40): lands 0.60 x 0.72, 0.25 between lands along the long side, 0.80 between the two columns, overall 2.10 x 3.73. The stencil aperture equals the land (p.39/40), so paste is not reduced. Pin order from the outline drawing (p.3/40) and the I/O table (p.5/40), top view: pins 1-4 run up the left column, 5-8 down the right column; pin 1 SDA, 2 INT, 3 LDR, 4 LED K, 5 LED A, 6 GND, 7 SCL, 8 VDD. The IR emitter is at the pin 4/5 end, the receiver 2.40 mm from it towards the pin 1/8 end; both need a clear view through the housing.")
  (tags "LTR-559 ambient light proximity sensor I2C Lite-On ChipLED")
